引博局提吳太子，殺之。於是遣其喪歸葬吳。吳王慍曰：「天下一宗，死長安即葬長安，何必來葬！」復遣喪之長安葬。吳王由是怨望，稍失藩臣禮，稱疾不朝。京師知其以子故，驗問實不病，諸吳使來，輒繫責治之。吳王恐，所謀滋甚。及後使人為秋請，上復責問吳使者。使者曰：「察見淵中魚，不祥。今吳王始詐疾，反覺，見責急，愈益閉，恐上誅之，計乃無聊。唯上與更始。」於是天子皆赦吳使者歸之，而賜吳王几杖，老，不朝。吳得釋，其謀亦益解。然其居國以銅鹽故，百姓無賦。卒踐更，輒予平賈。歲時存問茂材，賞賜閭里。它郡國吏欲來捕亡人者，頌共禁不與。如此者三十餘年，以故能使其眾。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-hanshu-035-jingyanwu:wuwang:m003-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"孝文","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-hanshu-035-jingyanwu:wuwang:m003-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"吳太子","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_CAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-hanshu-035-jingyanwu:wuwang:m003-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"皇太子","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-hanshu-035-jingyanwu:wuwang:m003-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"吳太子","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_CAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-hanshu-035-jingyanwu:wuwang:m003-0041","start":41,"end":44,"surface":"皇太子","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-hanshu-035-jingyanwu:wuwang:m003-0048","start":48,"end":51,"surface":"吳太子","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_CAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-hanshu-035-jingyanwu:wuwang:m003-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_CA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-hanshu-035-jingyanwu:wuwang:m003-0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_CA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-hanshu-035-jingyanwu:wuwang:m003-0140","start":140,"end":142,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_CA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-hanshu-035-jingyanwu:wuwang:m003-0180","start":180,"end":182,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_CA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-